  "solution": "__**LOGIC**__**:** **(First Number)³ × 2 = Second Number**\n\n**In 8 : 1024 →**\n\n= 8³ × 2\n\n= 512 × 2\n\n= 1024\n\n**In 9 : 1458 →**\n\n= 9³ × 2\n\n= 729 × 2\n\n= 1458\n\n**In 11 : 2662 →**\n\n= 11³ × 2\n\n= 1331 × 2\n\n= 2662\n\nHence, the correct answer is \"**1458\".**",
